{"id":"d68fff2773925f27","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-ns-ideal.md","title":"Nonstationary Ideal","display":"df-ns-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ns-ideal","aliases":["58-df-ns-ideal"],"display":"df-ns-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ns-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ns-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ns-ideal — Nonstationary Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\\in V\">\\(\\omega_1\\in V\\)</span> (first uncountable ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"27ae6ad867a7007d\" href=\"?note=27ae6ad867a7007d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md\">../batch17/58-df-omega1.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (club-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NS_{\\omega_1}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)\">\\(NS_{\\omega_1}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)\\)</span> (nonstationary ideal defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ns\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash NS_{\\omega_1}\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\omega_1 \\mid \\exists C\\subseteq\\omega_1\\;(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\omega_1)\\land X\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ns\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash NS_{\\omega_1}\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\omega_1 \\mid \\exists C\\subseteq\\omega_1\\;(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\omega_1)\\land X\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NS_{\\omega_1}\">\\(NS_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> is the ideal of nonstationary subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>A set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X \\subseteq \\omega_1\">\\(X \\subseteq \\omega_1\\)</span> is in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"NS_{\\omega_1}\">\\(NS_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> iff it misses some club set</li>\n<li>The quotient algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(\\omega_1)/NS_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(\\omega_1)/NS_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> is the forcing to add a club through every stationary set</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-omega1.md","status":"resolved","id":"27ae6ad867a7007d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega_1\\in V$ (first uncountable ordinal, see [[../batch17/58-df-omega1.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Club}\\subseteq V^2$ (club-subset predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-club.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega_1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"NS_{\\omega_1}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ns\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash NS_{\\omega_1}\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq\\omega_1 \\mid \\exists C\\subseteq\\omega_1\\;(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\omega_1)\\land X\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"NS_{\\omega_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"X \\subseteq \\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"NS_{\\omega_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}(\\omega_1)/NS_{\\omega_1}","display":false}],"bytes":1050,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-891","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-ns-ideal.md|58-df-ns-ideal]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["27ae6ad867a7007d","04670bdc8b64b8dd"]}